<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sea World year net up 14.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sea World year net up 14.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 10.27 vs 8.99</p>
<p>    Net profit			 10.27 vs 8.99</p>
<p>    Sales				16.00 vs 14.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Sea World Property Trust is the lessor of Queensland fun park Sea World. It is also the joint lessor of Sea World Nara Resort and lessor of Warner Bros Movie World theme park, Wet 'N Wild water park and Warner Roadshow Movie World Studios.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
